Something like that.  Maybe full text in Lojban and a summary in 
english so that you are motivated to understand more Lojban but you 
still know what's going on if you don't.  What do other people think 
here?

>  Would you like beginner lessons?
Maybe.  This doesn't have to be every week either.  Even if just at the 
end of each show you have.  "This show was brought to you by the words: 
..." and give some definitions.  (this can be amusing too.  especially 
if you can keep a straight face)

